<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Industrial Ontology Foundry"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Industrial Ontology Foundry (IOF) Core Ontology" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Core Ontology"@en-US .
