<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:iofcorecb17731580c355a2eb601480cbd1b0fbcf43fc192a39da4ecc6a9e6b28b9456e469 .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has post-condition"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialStateSpecification> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000110> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "a mixing specification has post-condition a material state specification specifying that the material is homogeneous; a cleaning specification has post-condition a material state specification specifying that the equipment is clean; a filling specification has post-condition a material state specification specifying that the receiving container is filled to the specified level; a thawing specification has post-condition a material state specification specifying that the material is completely thawed; a valve-opening specification has post-condition a material state specification specifying that the valve is open" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> "∀p,d,o,m((hasPostCondition(p,d) ∧ prescribes(p,o) ∧ prescribes(d,m)) → ∃m'(hasPostMaterialState(o,m') ∧ holdsIn(m,m')))" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> "relation between an action specification or plan specification and a material state specification such that every material state prescribed by the material state specification holds in a post-state of every process or event prescribed by the action specification or plan specification"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPostCondition> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> "if p 'has post condition' d, p 'prescribes' o, and d 'prescribes' m, then o 'has post material state' some m' in which m 'holds in'" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:iofcorecb227e925c42e1bd9587dc3c83456b5c11c9e8c3eba46d38c4c539715b20feead7d .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has pre-condition"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialStateSpecification> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000110> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "a sample-loading specification has pre-condition a material state specification specifying that the chromatography column is equilibrated; an inoculation specification has pre-condition a material state specification specifying that the bioreactor is sterile and the culture medium is at the inoculation temperature" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> "∀p,d,o,m((hasPreCondition(p,d) ∧ prescribes(p,o) ∧ prescribes(d,m)) → ∃m'(hasPreMaterialState(o,m') ∧ holdsIn(m,m')))" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> "relation between an Action Specification or Plan Specification and a Material State Specification such that every material state prescribed by the Material State Specification holds in a pre-state of every process or event prescribed by the Action Specification or Plan Specification."@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/Core/hasPreCondition> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> "if p 'has postcondition' d, p 'prescribes' o, and d 'prescribes' m, then o 'has pre material state' some m' in which m 'holds in'" .
